WEBVTT

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.360
<i>Hanamaru Kindergarten</i>

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:34.630
Hey Tsuchi, why don't we go somewhere this Sunday?

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:37.260
I can't. I'm busy Sunday.

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:39.610
Busy? With what?

00:01:40.230 --> 00:01:43.540
Well, you know. Adults are busy people.

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:45.040
You're busy with adult things?

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:47.600
Do you have another lover?

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.850
No, that's not what I...

00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:53.660
I knew it! How could you?

00:01:55.390 --> 00:01:58.960
He said he doesn't have a lover, but he seemed awfully suspicious.

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:02.700
Maybe he hasn't asked me out because he's seeing someone else.

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:06.250
I think that may be unlikely in the case of Tsuchida-sensei...

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:09.180
But he's so cool.

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:12.790
He might not be interested in dating, but there could be women asking him out.

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:15.690
I need to find out what he's doing on Sunday.

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:17.710
That's a profession, right?

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:20.270
A detective investigates all kinds of things.

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:22.930
That's the one. I'm going to be a detective.

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:28.720
I think I understand the situation, but are you sure you'll be okay by yourselves?

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:31.110
We'll be fine. We won't be going far.

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:32.670
I'm going to borrow this.

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:34.940
Call me if something happens.

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:36.400
Okay.

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:40.730
"A Hanamaru Detective"

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:47.440
Huh? I'm back at the beginning.

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:52.490
I guess I'll go back to sleep.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:54.890
Who's calling?

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.570
Hello, this is Tsuchida.

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:01.320
Hello, Tsuchi.

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:05.370
Oh, Anzu. Why are you calling this early in the morning?

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:08.010
It's not morning. It's already the afternoon.

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:08.750
The afternoon?

00:03:09.390 --> 00:03:11.020
Are you at home?

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:13.050
Yeah, I am. Why?

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:15.000
Oh, nothing.

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:18.930
Don't waste your entire Sunday staying indoors.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:22.020
What was that about?

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.070
Tsuchi's still inside.

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:31.420
I'm not sure a detective would call a person she's about to investigate.

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:34.650
Tsuchida-sensei is leaving his apartment.

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:39.360
I shouldn't waste my day inside, huh?

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:45.050
Okay! Let's start fo... fo...

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:46.690
What is it, again?

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:47.520
Follow.

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:50.010
Right, that. Let's follow him.

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:54.720
The Hanamaru Detective Brigade is on the move!

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:13.730
I felt like someone was watching me...

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:15.120
...but I must be imagining things.

00:04:19.770 --> 00:04:22.800
Look, Anzu-chan. A cat.

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:25.460
It's a kitty.

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:28.100
It's so cute.

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:29.280
So cute.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:32.300
Anzu-chan, we need to keep following him.

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:37.970
I haven't seen this in a while.

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:43.430
Is this Makoto Hyuga?

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:45.760
Maybe I'll get an Ayanami.

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:53.030
He's buying a lot.

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:56.180
He's probably frustrated he can't get the one he wants.

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:57.710
He could never buy that many on a child's allowance.

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:05.800
So this is what he likes.

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:08.290
There's a panda-cat one over here.

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:09.560
You're right.

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:11.860
It's 100 yen. How expensive.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:14.070
I have 100 yen.

00:05:14.170 --> 00:05:15.180
Do you want to try it?

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:17.620
I don't know...

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:17.620
Anzu-chan, Koume-chan.

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:18.720
We've got to stay on his trail.

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:20.720
"Hanamaru Shopping Center"

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:28.350
Make sure you don't lose sight of Tsuchida-sensei.

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:30.500
Okay, I'll make sure I don't.

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:32.460
Look at the weird sign.

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:35.440
You're right. It's so funny.

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:40.990
I guess kindergarten students don't make good detectives after all.

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:49.970
He went inside the restaurant.

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:52.020
Maybe he's meeting his girlfriend there.

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:00.020
Tsuchida-sensei's smiling.

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:03.700
He must be waiting for his beloved.

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:07.110
How could he! Tsuchi's a liar!

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:10.570
That jerk, that jerk, that jerk...

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:13.780
He's been smiling this whole time.

00:06:14.110 --> 00:06:15.180
That's strange.

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:17.950
What do you mean?

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:22.160
He's still in a good mood even though his girlfriend never showed up.

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:25.970
He might just be enjoying himself looking at the waitresses.

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:32.390
She sure is cute.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:36.230
That girl's got a big chest.

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:41.910
Looks like I'm right.

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.690
Their uniforms are pretty cute.

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:47.330
I'm not worried about it.

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:50.050
At least he isn't waiting for a girlfriend.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.230
You're pathetic, Tsuchi.

00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:00.200
That idol's finally showing her goods.

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:03.240
He's reading an adult magazine.

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:04.620
An adult magazine.

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:06.060
Adult?

00:07:07.270 --> 00:07:09.080
He can't help himself.

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:13.550
The TV said healthy men are interested in that kind of thing.

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:18.170
I don't have a problem with that!

00:07:18.610 --> 00:07:20.670
I'm better than those girls!

00:07:19.050 --> 00:07:21.180
Oh, come on.

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:28.570
Yikes.

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:31.670
I'll just avoid making eye contact.

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:40.490
I guess I don't need this.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:44.910
Hey, bro.

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:48.430
Yeah, you.

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:50.350
W-what is it?

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:52.230
Come here. I want to tell you something.

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:53.550
S-something to tell me?

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:56.880
But I don't have anything to say.

00:07:56.980 --> 00:07:59.700
You'd better listen to the boss and get over here.

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:00.680
The boss?

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.120
Now, hold on...

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:04.260
What's going on?

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:07.250
It looks like they're picking a fight with Tsuchida-sensei.

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:08.390
Picking a fight?

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:11.430
Those scary people are accusing him of doing something bad.

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:16.050
This doesn't look good.

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:18.720
Come on.

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:20.240
Stop right there.

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:23.860
Sakura-senpai?

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:25.630
Mommy?

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:30.130
What do you think you're doing, harassing a harmless boy like him?

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:32.320
Harmless?

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:34.850
If you don't stop what you're doing, I'll call the cops.

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:36.420
Listen, sister...

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:39.300
You're no brother of mine.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:45.560
That's a good one. You're a funny lady.

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:48.550
It seems you've misunderstood the situation.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:09:00.120
We just wanted to tell him to throw his trash away properly.

00:09:03.450 --> 00:09:08.890
Our group's committed to working for our community, see?

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:10.410
"Hanamaru Shopping Center"

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:10.410
"Working together to create a litter-free city!"

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:16.950
I'm so sorry. I'll be more careful in the future.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:18.220
Don't worry about it.

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:22.060
Listen sister, you've got a great spirit.

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:24.020
Maybe we'll meet again someday.

00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:25.430
Sure.

00:09:27.110 --> 00:09:29.770
You saved me again, senpai.

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:33.260
I haven't changed since high school.

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:35.690
I think you've matured since then.

00:09:36.690 --> 00:09:40.700
In the past, dealing with those guys would have brought you to tears.

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:43.110
What? How can you say that?

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:47.820
By the way, what are you doing here?

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:54.420
That's right, I've got some business to attend to. I'll see you later.

00:09:57.230 --> 00:09:59.410
She's got a lot of energy, as usual.

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:03.930
I don't get it. Did mommy save Tsuchi?

00:10:04.190 --> 00:10:05.130
It seems that way.

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:11.160
I hope they haven't noticed I'm following them.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:28.160
We're going drinking next week, right?

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:32.620
Huh? You're seeing someone?

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:35.130
Really? That's great.

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:36.390
Yeah.

00:10:36.790 --> 00:10:37.380
Yeah.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:38.880
What about me?

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:42.610
I've got my eye on someone, but that's not going anywhere.

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:45.090
Besides, I'm still getting used to work.

00:10:46.230 --> 00:10:46.780
Yeah.

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:48.380
Got it.

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:50.510
You've got a date, right?

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:55.990
I see. He was going to go drinking with a girl...

00:10:56.190 --> 00:11:01.120
...but she's going on a date with her new boyfriend.

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:03.510
He seemed a little too happy for that.

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:06.140
And I'm the girl he has his eye on.

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:11.150
I guess I don't have any plans for next Sunday, either.

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:19.190
I guess this is what an adult's day off is like.

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:22.150
Tsuchida-sensei seems lonely.

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:27.910
You're right.

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:33.760
Whoops.

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:36.820
Tsuchi.

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:40.470
Cheer up.

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:45.150
Anzu, Hiiragi, Koume. What are you doing here?

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:49.060
Tsuchi, you were supposed to go on a date, but she dumped you, right?

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:50.870
A date? Dumped?

00:11:51.090 --> 00:11:52.070
What are you talking about?

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:54.880
Poor Tsuchi.

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:58.070
Are you crying? What's wrong?

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:03.730
I see. So that's why you were following me.

00:12:03.760 --> 00:12:07.050
I was worried you might be cheating on me.

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:09.320
I see.

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:15.660
Want to get some <i>taiyaki</i>?

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:17.690
I found a place that has great <i>taiyaki</i> the other day.

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:20.620
<i>Taiyaki</i>? Let's go.

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:24.410
I like <i>taiyaki</i> filled from tail to tip with red bean paste.

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:27.090
I guess that wraps up the Detective Brigade's work.

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:31.830
I'm worried about Tsuchi's personal life, though.

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:39.350
I don't mind if you read adult magazines in the convenience store.

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:43.710
And I'll forgive you for ogling the waitresses.

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:46.960
You guys saw that, too?

00:12:47.420 --> 00:12:48.810
We're detectives.

00:12:49.340 --> 00:12:51.550
I wish you hadn't seen that.

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:01.610
Green light.

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:02.960
Red light.

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:14.040
Tsuchi, let's talk about our future together.

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:15.330
Sure, let's do that later.

00:13:15.590 --> 00:13:17.850
But I want to talk about it now.

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:19.020
Anzu-chan.

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:24.990
Anzu-chan, nice jump.

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:27.960
I want a one story house with a yard.

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:27.960
Wait, Anzu-chan.

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:30.230
I'll go with you.

00:13:31.170 --> 00:13:34.370
I want a dog and lots of kids.

00:13:34.400 --> 00:13:37.100
Anzu-chan, Hii-chan...

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:39.180
Are you okay?

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:42.870
Are you hurt? Can you get up?

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:50.820
Uh, um...

00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:58.440
Yu-kun, let's go outside.

00:13:58.670 --> 00:13:59.720
Okay.

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:01.690
Will you be okay?

00:14:02.260 --> 00:14:03.680
Y-yes.

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:06.490
You shouldn't run in the hallways.

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:11.790
"A Hanamaru First Love"

00:14:12.920 --> 00:14:16.210
Koume-chan, sorry for leaving you behind.

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:18.300
Koume-chan?

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.050
What's wrong?

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:24.080
Well, um...

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:26.260
Yes?

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:28.240
I tripped, and...

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:29.360
I see.

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:36.110
That boy was nice to you.

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:36.900
Yes.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:39.310
They called him Yu-kun.

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:41.390
What are you doing, master?

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:45.910
That's Yu, Daigo, and Haruto.

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:47.740
What about them?

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:50.900
Kenji-kun, do you know them?

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:53.850
Of course. They're in the Sunflower Class, too.

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:58.370
But master, you don't need to be so formal with me.

00:14:58.630 --> 00:15:00.530
There's no need for honorifics.

00:15:00.530 --> 00:15:02.470
What? B-but...

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:04.740
Please, master.

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:08.980
Investigation complete.

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:13.820
I've gathered information from teachers and other students.

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:17.410
His name is Yu Kobayakawa.

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:20.560
He's a second year from the Sunflower Class, and the eldest son of a family of four.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.060
His father is a diplomat.

00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:25.370
His blood type is O, and his favorite food is hamburgers.

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:27.240
So he's a second year.

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:30.410
He's just a kid compared to Tsuchi.

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.240
H-he's not a kid.

00:15:32.310 --> 00:15:34.330
And Tsuchi's better looking.

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:36.470
Yu-kun is good looking, too.

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:40.470
You should tell him how you feel.

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:46.240
Doesn't your chest tighten up when you think of Yu-kun?

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:49.900
And when your eyes meet, your heart starts pounding?

00:15:51.310 --> 00:15:53.690
That's love. You've got to tell him how you feel.

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:56.740
I tell Tsuchi how I feel about him every single day.

00:15:57.160 --> 00:15:59.830
There goes Anzu-chan, straightforward as always.

00:16:00.510 --> 00:16:02.900
But Anzu-chan may be right.

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:03.870
Right?

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:05.000
Why?

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:09.720
Well, Yu-kun may move tomorrow...

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:14.540
...or aliens may come to abduct him...

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:17.750
...or the Second Impact may happen tomorrow...

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:19.840
...or the Ishbal War.

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:23.510
Are you okay?

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.640
Sorry. I went too far.

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:29.350
I'm fine now.

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:32.760
You're right. I should give it my best shot.

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:35.220
I need to properly thank Yu-kun.

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:38.150
But I don't know if I can...

00:16:38.820 --> 00:16:44.310
Don't worry. If you refine your femininity, you'll naturally become more confident.

00:16:44.530 --> 00:16:45.610
Femininity?

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:46.660
Refine?

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:49.130
You can't skimp on your daily skincare.

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:51.850
Practice smiling in the mirror.

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:55.180
Massage yourself in the bath. Bathing just half your body is effective, too.

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:57.620
If you don't get out soon, you'll become a prune.

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:01.850
Just a little longer. I've got to be beautiful for Tsuchi.

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:05.980
But even though I'm this healthy and cute...

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:10.600
...Tsuchi won't pay attention to me because he's worried what society will think.

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:12.260
That jerk.

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:14.750
Anzu-chan, we're starting to get off track.

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:19.130
If you're embarrassed to talk to him directly, why don't you write him a letter?

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:20.690
I could do that.

00:17:21.530 --> 00:17:22.870
Let's see.

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:25.000
I'm going to write a letter, too.

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:27.670
What should I write?

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:30.540
You should write exactly what you feel now.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:31.610
Oh, right.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:37.140
I'm finished. I'm going to show Tsuchi my love letter.

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:39.400
How do you write "thank you?"

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:45.380
If Koume-chan cannot write, there's a possibility Yu-kun won't be able to read.

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:49.090
Did I do something wrong?

00:17:49.090 --> 00:17:51.230
No, it's just a matter of age.

00:17:51.230 --> 00:17:54.480
(<i>Hanamaru</i> are symbols awarded to Japanese students for good work the same way American students receive gold stars.)

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:55.310
Look! I got a <i>hanamaru</i> from Tsuchi!

00:17:55.850 --> 00:17:57.940
How's your love letter coming along, Koume-chan?

00:17:57.970 --> 00:17:59.860
Writing a letter might be too difficult.

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:03.950
If you don't think you can have a long conversation with him...

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:07.080
...why don't you write a short thank you note, or give him a present?

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:10.230
What a wonderful idea.

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:14.140
You should give him whatever you want.

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:20.460
Yu-kun, the girls...

00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:24.620
Uh, um...

00:18:25.070 --> 00:18:26.470
You're that first year from earlier today.

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:28.490
Was everything okay?

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:30.220
H-here.

00:18:37.890 --> 00:18:38.860
Are you okay?

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:43.280
My tokens.

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:44.620
Let's pick them up together.

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:46.000
Okay.

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:49.080
What a mature boy.

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:54.710
I was too nervous to talk to Yu-kun.

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:58.950
That's got to be love. Isn't it bittersweet?

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:02.560
Asking to meet him somewhere might be easier for you.

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:04.530
You'd only need to wait for him.

00:19:05.150 --> 00:19:07.010
That might be better.

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:10.630
It'll be just like confessing your love behind the school buildings.

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:13.220
The right time and place are essential.

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.800
I'll go get Yu-kun.

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:20.700
I'm starting to get nervous.

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:25.100
Anzu-chan and Hiiragi-chan are doing so much to help me.

00:19:25.650 --> 00:19:29.200
I need to thank Yu-kun properly this time.

00:19:29.370 --> 00:19:32.450
Let's think of what you'll say to confess your love to Yu-kun.

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:34.340
What I'll say?

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:36.950
I've got the perfect line for you.

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:41.680
This will make Yu-kun fall in love with you.

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:42.340
Okay.

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:44.750
What are you up to? Planning a prank?

00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:47.000
Tsuchida-sensei.

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:50.770
It's not a prank. We're discussing Koume's confession of love.

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:53.010
Koume's confession?

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:54.550
Anzu-chan.

00:19:54.760 --> 00:19:56.890
Oh, no. I let it slip.

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:01.990
Sounds pretty typical for Anzu, but I hope Koume isn't getting herself into trouble.

00:20:02.670 --> 00:20:06.670
Thank you for taking the time to come all the way here.

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:09.740
Was it Koume-chan? What did she want to tell me?

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:14.300
Excuse me.

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:18.070
Go for it, Koume-chan.

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:19.100
Okay.

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:23.910
I hope she's okay.

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:27.400
Um, Yu-kun...

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:28.340
What is it?

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:31.150
There's something I want to tell you.

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:34.010
Looking good, Koume-chan.

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:34.980
You can do it.

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:36.220
Yu-kun.

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:40.480
H-hold me!

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:42.490
She did it!

00:20:46.630 --> 00:20:47.320
Hold you?

00:20:47.940 --> 00:20:51.150
That's how my mommy confessed to daddy.

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:53.030
What did you want to talk to me about?

00:20:53.170 --> 00:20:57.170
That was supposed to work.

00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:04.720
Hey Yu-kun, are you done yet?

00:21:05.150 --> 00:21:06.630
Didn't you say you'd play outside with us?

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:09.480
I'll go in a minute. Just wait.

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:10.650
Okay.

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:17.370
Yu-kun put off seeing his friends for me.

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:21.450
Um, Yu-kun.

00:21:22.230 --> 00:21:22.950
Yes?

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:25.840
I, um...

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:31.950
Thank you for helping me earlier.

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:35.460
I wanted to thank you.

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:40.140
I see. You're welcome.

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:41.620
You did it.

00:21:41.720 --> 00:21:43.860
Good girl.

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:45.640
Sensei.

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:46.620
Koume-chan.

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:49.260
Come play outside with me.

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:53.560
Youth.

00:21:53.710 --> 00:21:55.530
It's all thanks to us.

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:56.440
It sure is.

00:23:30.890 --> 00:23:32.000
Uh, um...

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:33.470
You can do it, Koume-chan.

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:34.750
Um, hold...

00:23:34.750 --> 00:23:35.380
Hold?

00:23:35.580 --> 00:23:36.500
Hold me.

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:37.430
You did it.

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:41.450
Next week, Tsuchida-sensei's younger sister Satsuki will be joining us.

00:23:41.530 --> 00:23:43.340
We also have a story about a pool.

00:23:41.960 --> 00:23:42.320
"A Hanamaru Pool"

00:23:42.320 --> 00:23:42.700
"A Hanamaru Gambit"

00:23:42.700 --> 00:23:43.120
"A Hanamaru Brother"

00:23:43.120 --> 00:23:43.530
"A Hanamaru Sleepover"

00:23:43.430 --> 00:23:44.700
Don't miss it.

00:23:44.700 --> 00:23:49.540
"See you next week!"
